---
// Padding is applied under `focus:`, not unconditionally: `not-sr-only`
// compiles to `padding: 0` and outranks a plain `px-*`/`py-*` utility, so an
// unprefixed padding class is dead here and the revealed link would hug its
// own border. z-[60]: above the sticky header (z-50), below the loader.
---

<a
  href="#main"
  class="tap-target sr-only border border-border bg-bg text-fg focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-[60] focus:px-3 focus:py-2"
  >本文へスキップ</a
>
